♪ When I was just a little boy ♪

105
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:48,915
♪ I asked my father ♪

106
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:50,792
♪ "What will I be?" ♪

107
00:04:52,652 --> 00:04:55,030
♪ "Will I be handsome?" ♪

108
00:04:55,055 --> 00:04:57,433
♪ "Will I be rich?" ♪

109
